<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal non-EU trade deficit narrows Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Portugal non-EU trade deficit narrows Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's trade deficit with countries outside the European Union fell 9.9 percent in the first 10 months of the year to 456.2 billion escudos, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos)</p>
<p>		    OCT 96  SEPT 96  OCT 95  JAN-OCT 96  JAN-OCT 95</p>
<p> Imports	   105.0    93.4   122.3    1,068.2     1,066.9</p>
<p> Exports	    70.3    54.2    68.2	612.0	 560.4</p>
<p> Deficit	    34.7    39.2    54.1	456.2	 505.5</p>
<p>Figures for 1996 are preliminary.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
